# UI evidence and local media never belong in the repository. Screenshots and
# recordings go to a temporary directory such as PW_ARTIFACT_DIR and are
# attached to the PR body instead; see _docs/pr-evidence.md.
#
# The one exception is a documentation image under _docs/assets/: it is part of
# a document, not a picture of a screen. scripts/check-media-artifacts.sh fails
# on every other path with these extensions, and also on an asset under
# _docs/assets/ that no document links to. Change both together.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.mkv
!_docs/assets/**
